        "Content": "Entrance Hall -  18' 7\"  x  4' 7\" \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room -  13' 3\"  x  9' 10\" \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom -  9' 2\"  x  4' 9\" \r\n\r\n\r\nFamily Room -  10' 9\"  x  9' 3\" \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen -  13' 3\"  x  5' 10\" \r\n\r\n\r\nUtility / W/C -  6' 7\"  x  5' 8\" \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 -  12' 7\"  x  8' 7\" \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 -  9' 6\"  x  7' 9\" \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 -  13' 3\"  x  10' 2\" \r\n\r\n\r\nPaved Back Yard - 27.0m x 8.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
